{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find My Frogs: Branches</strong> is a cozy hidden object game where you search for frogs and toads in a hand-drawn village nestled high in the branches of an ancient tree. Explore charming corners, discover tiny secrets, and help Uncle Froger find his missing hat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore</strong> the hand-drawn village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 <strong>Find</strong> 300 Frogs and Toads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Discover</strong> 50+ hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Choose</strong> between day or night, or let time flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Relax</strong> in a soothing atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With calming animations and sounds, soothing music, and playful interactions, <strong>Find My Frogs: Branches</strong> offers a sweet moment of serenity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find My Frogs: Branches is a passion project by a duo of artists.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948760?t=1765975977","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948760/e1ed61eb1bec0f98984f4da60a67ef149793a8a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765975977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948760/1db0e9101047874fde2852c8032cdd86d4a7131c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765975977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948760/1db0e9101047874fde2852c8032cdd86d4a7131c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765975977","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"d